ccreditation Officer, SOE Staff Regular part-time (staff <29 hours) Closing at: Sep 16 2026 - 23:55 PDT The Assessment and Accreditation Officer will provide support and leadership to all departments in the School of Education in assessment and evaluation of programs and strategic initiatives. The Assessment and Accreditation Officer will sustain overall assessment, accreditation, and reporting for the School of Education. Read more Adjunct Instructor, Teacher Certification Supervisor Adjunct Adjunct Closing at: Sep 7 2026 - 23:55 PDT Gonzaga University’s School of Education Teacher Certification Program is currently seeking certified teachers interested in supervising Pre-Service Teacher Candidates at the K-12 levels, in all content areas in the Greater Spokane Area for the academic year.\n\nA Teacher Certification Supervisor is a mentor and a liaison in coordinating the functions between the teacher candidates, mentor teachers, and the department. Read more Adjunct Instructor, Doctoral Program in Leadership Studies Adjunct Adjunct The Doctoral Program in Leadership Studies at Gonzaga University in Spokane, Washington invites applications for its Adjunct Instructor Pool. This pool focuses on teaching doctoral-level research courses, including classes such as Principles of Research and Quantitative Research Methods. Read more Assistant Director, Alumni Programs Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Closing at: Sep 9 2026 - 23:55 PDT Help strengthen the lifelong connection between Gonzaga and its alumni around the world. As the Assistant Director, Alumni Programs, you'll create meaningful opportunities for Zags to connect, mentor, volunteer, and support one another while advancing the University's mission. Read more Assistant Professor, Psychology (Neuroscience) Faculty Tenure Track Faculty (Full-time) Closing at: Oct 26 2026 - 23:55 PDT The Department of Psychology and Neuroscience at Gonzaga University in Spokane, WA invites applicants for a full-time Assistant Professor position (tenure-track) in Neuroscience beginning August 16, 2027. Read more Lecturer, Political Science Faculty Non-Tenure Track Faculty (Full-time) Closing at: Sep 28 2026 - 23:55 PDT The Department of Political Science at Gonzaga University in Spokane, WA invites applications for a full-time, nine-month, non-tenure-track Lecturer position in Comparative Politics, with a specialization in Latin America, beginning August 16, 2027. Read more Event House Manager (On-Call) Staff Event Staff Closing at: Sep 7 2026 - 23:55 PDT Help bring world-class arts to the Spokane and Gonzaga campus communities by joining the Myrtle Woldson Performing Arts Center as an on-call Event House Manager. Perfect for flexible schedules, we need adaptable, customer-focused leaders ready to guide front-of-house operations through the fast-paced rush of guest arrivals down to the focused, quiet rhythm of a live show, all while overseeing venue safety, volunteer coordination, and seamless show execution. Read more Assistant Professor, Mechanical Engineering Faculty Tenure Track Faculty (Full-time) Closing at: Oct 9 2026 - 23:55 PDT The School of Engineering and Applied Science at Gonzaga University in Spokane, Washington, invites applications for an Assistant Professor in the Mechanical Engineering Department beginning Fall 2027. Read more Assistant Professor, Law Faculty Tenure Track Faculty (Full-time) Closing at: Oct 16 2026 - 23:55 PDT Join Gonzaga University School of Law as a tenure-track Assistant Professor in beautiful Spokane, WA, starting August 2027. We are looking for passionate educators across all legal subject areas to inspire the next generation of lawyers while earning a competitive salary. Read more Senior Construction Manager & Space Planner Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Closing at: Sep 15 2026 - 23:55 PDT Ready to Leave a Lasting Mark? Join the Plant & Construction Services team as the Senior Leader for Campus Construction and Space Planning and help us shape the future of Gonzaga University. Read more Administrative Assistant to CFO Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Closing at: Sep 8 2026 - 23:55 PDT Join Gonzaga University as the Administrative Assistant to the CFO, providing high-level administrative and operational support to both the Chief Financial Officer and Chief Information Officer. This role is ideal for a highly organized, service-oriented professional who excels at managing executive priorities, coordinating complex schedules and meetings, and supporting leaders across Finance and Administration. Read more Instructional Lab Manager Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Closing at: Sep 13 2026 - 23:55 PDT The Department of Biology at Gonzaga University invites applications for a Instructional Lab Manager to prepare laboratory facilities and reagents for multi-section laboratory courses, assist with the implementation of lab curricula, teach lab sections, and  supervise teaching assistants and student workers. The lab courses include Introductory Microbiology 170L, Microbiology 370L, and Genetics 207L. Read more Electrician Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Join Gonzaga University as a Journeyman Electrician and play a pivotal role in enhancing, preserving, and revitalizing our campus infrastructure. Read more Assistant Professor, Electrical and Computer Engineering Faculty Tenure Track Faculty (Full-time) Closing at: Oct 1 2026 - 23:55 PDT The School of Engineering and Applied Science at Gonzaga University in Spokane, Washington, invites applications for an Assistant Professor in the Electrical and Computer Engineering Department beginning Fall 2027. Read more Assistant Professor, Chemistry Faculty Tenure Track Faculty (Full-time) Closing at: Sep 15 2026 - 23:55 PDT We seek a teacher-scholar with expertise in experimental organic chemistry or biochemistry. Read more Adjunct Instructor, Music (Applied Voice) Adjunct Adjunct The Music Department at Gonzaga University in Spokane, Washington, is seeking an instructor to teach applied voice lessons - including a weekly studio class. Read more Adjunct Instructor, Special Education & Applied Behavior Analysis Adjunct Adjunct Seeking qualified adjunct instructors to teach American Sign Language and Deaf Culture courses. Successful candidates will bring native or near-native ASL proficiency, cultural expertise, and a commitment to engaging, inclusive instruction. Join us in preparing students to communicate effectively and respectfully within the Deaf community. Read more Adjunct Instructor, Physics Adjunct Adjunct The Department of Physics at Gonzaga University in Spokane, Washington, is seeking instructors to teach introductory physics laboratory courses for majors and non-majors. Read more Assistant Professor, Biology Faculty Tenure Track Faculty (Full-time) Closing at: Sep 21 2026 - 23:55 PDT The Department of Biology at Gonzaga University in Spokane, WA invites applicants for a full-time Assistant Professor position (tenure-track) in Biology beginning August 16, 2027. We are seeking a neurobiologist specializing in research with model organisms. Read more Adjunct Instructor, Dance Adjunct Adjunct Gonzaga Dance Program seeks to hire an adjunct instructor for the Fall of 2026. Read more Adjunct Instructor, Chemistry Adjunct Adjunct Gonzaga University is searching for adjunct instructors to join the Department of Chemistry and Biochemistry for the upcoming semester. Read more Clinical Adjunct Instructor, Psych-Mental Health Nurse Practitioner Adjunct Adjunct The Department of Nursing is seeking adjunct clinical faculty to work with psych mental health nurse practitioner graduate students in their practicum nursing courses. Read more Clinical Adjunct Instructor, Family Nurse Practitioner Adjunct Adjunct The Department of Nursing is seeking adjunct clinical faculty to work with family nurse practitioner graduate students in their practicum nursing courses. The successful candidate will have the enthusiasm, clinical presence, and practical expertise to engage students in active learning and assessment and should be committed to pursuing excellence in teaching and promoting an inclusive learning environment. Read more Clinical Adjunct Instructor, BSN Adjunct Adjunct The Department of Nursing is seeking adjunct clinical faculty to provide clinical instruction and supervision to students in the BSN program. Clinical faculty may also mentor clinical staff in the Designated Education Units (DEUs) of community partner facilities who are working directly with BSN students. Read more Adjunct Instructor, School of Law Adjunct Adjunct The School of Law is looking to hire adjuncts to teach in various areas. These areas include Professional Responsibility, Lawyering Skills, Legal Research and Writing, Wills and Trusts, Property, Family Law and more. Read more Adjunct Instructor, Kinesiology and Sport Management Adjunct Adjunct The Department of Kinesiology and Sport Management at Gonzaga University in Spokane, Washington, invites applications for its Adjunct Faculty Pool within the Kinesiology program. We welcome applications from individuals that have backgrounds in Kinesiology and that can contribute to our vibrant and growing student-centered program. Successful candidates will have the enthusiasm, classroom/lab presence and skills to engage students and should be committed to pursuing excellence in teaching and promoting an inclusive learning environment. Read more Displaying all 29 entries Diversity & Inclusion At Gonzaga University, we are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse community where differences in age, gender, ethnicity, disability, social class, religion, culture, sexual orientation, and language enrich our campus. We value mutual respect and aim to create a welcoming, accessible environment for all members of our community, in line with our Jesuit, Catholic, and humanistic mission. Gonzaga University is an equal opportunity employer and encourage