reditation Officer, SOE Staff Regular part-time (staff <29 hours) Closing at: Sep 16 2026 - 23:55 PDT The Assessment and Accreditation Officer will provide support and leadership to all departments in the School of Education in assessment and evaluation of programs and strategic initiatives. The Assessment and Accreditation Officer will sustain overall assessment, accreditation, and reporting for the School of Education. Read more Assistant Director, Alumni Programs Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Closing at: Sep 9 2026 - 23:55 PDT Help strengthen the lifelong connection between Gonzaga and its alumni around the world. As the Assistant Director, Alumni Programs, you'll create meaningful opportunities for Zags to connect, mentor, volunteer, and support one another while advancing the University's mission. Read more Event House Manager (On-Call) Staff Event Staff Closing at: Sep 7 2026 - 23:55 PDT Help bring world-class arts to the Spokane and Gonzaga campus communities by joining the Myrtle Woldson Performing Arts Center as an on-call Event House Manager. Perfect for flexible schedules, we need adaptable, customer-focused leaders ready to guide front-of-house operations through the fast-paced rush of guest arrivals down to the focused, quiet rhythm of a live show, all while overseeing venue safety, volunteer coordination, and seamless show execution. Read more Senior Construction Manager & Space Planner Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Closing at: Sep 15 2026 - 23:55 PDT Ready to Leave a Lasting Mark? Join the Plant & Construction Services team as the Senior Leader for Campus Construction and Space Planning and help us shape the future of Gonzaga University. Read more Administrative Assistant to CFO Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Closing at: Sep 8 2026 - 23:55 PDT Join Gonzaga University as the Administrative Assistant to the CFO, providing high-level administrative and operational support to both the Chief Financial Officer and Chief Information Officer. This role is ideal for a highly organized, service-oriented professional who excels at managing executive priorities, coordinating complex schedules and meetings, and supporting leaders across Finance and Administration. Read more Instructional Lab Manager Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Closing at: Sep 13 2026 - 23:55 PDT The Department of Biology at Gonzaga University invites applications for a Instructional Lab Manager to prepare laboratory facilities and reagents for multi-section laboratory courses, assist with the implementation of lab curricula, teach lab sections, and  supervise teaching assistants and student workers. The lab courses include Introductory Microbiology 170L, Microbiology 370L, and Genetics 207L. Read more Electrician Staff Regular full-time (staff 30+ hours) Join Gonzaga University as a Journeyman Electrician and play a pivotal role in enhancing, preserving, and revitalizing our campus infrastructure. Read more Displaying all 10 entries Diversity & Inclusion At Gonzaga University, we are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse community where differences in age, gender, ethnicity, disability, social class, religion, culture, sexual orientation, and language enrich our campus. We value mutual respect and aim to create a welcoming, accessible environment for all members of our community, in line with our Jesuit, Catholic, and humanistic mission. Gonzaga University is an equal opportunity employer and encourages diversity candidates to apply. All qualified applicants will be considered without regard to disability, veteran status, gender, race, or other protected categories. Categories Staff Careers Faculty Careers Quick Links Spokane & Community Our Mission Privacy Policy GU Home Copyright © 2026 All Rights Reserved by Gonzaga University . Candidate Details We use cookies. Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalize, improve content and services to show you the most r